rets for the player to find. You can find loads of different upgrades like rings, spells, weapons and moveset upgrades for the player. The world is interconnected with different upgrades allowing you to access areas that you previously could not.</p>","developers":["Kyle Burgin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631260/c2f071bcf91c5cd9e274ec26545731f89ab5d8ec/header.jpg?t=1744145352","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122393,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122393/movie480.mp4?t=1744145350","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122393/movie_max.mp4?t=1744145350"},"name":"trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122393/dec7b636d31d378d4df7d06a7a2ef55809f45baf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744145350","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122393/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744145350","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122393/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744145350"}}],"name":"The Sunken City","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kyle Burgin"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descripto